{"articleNo":"1300","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1300&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2011 몽골 정부초청 장학생 선발안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.08","hit":"11078","attachments":[{"name":"지원서B(몽골정부 소정양식-영문).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1300&attachNo=69822"},{"name":"2010-2011 몽골 정부초청장학생 선발요강.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1300&attachNo=69916"},{"name":"지원서A(본원 소정양식-국문).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1300&attachNo=69987"},{"name":"건강진단서(영문).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1300&attachNo=70446"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"85\" bgcolor=\"#000000\" height=\"4\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 0.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"479\" bgcolor=\"#006ddb\" height=\"4\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 0.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"563\" bgcolor=\"#efefef\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font size=\"4\">2010-2011 몽골 정부초청 장학생 선발요강</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"85\" bgcolor=\"#ea0000\" height=\"4\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 0.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"479\" bgcolor=\"#000000\" height=\"4\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 0.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">1. 과정/인원/기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 과정 : 학/석/박사과정 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 최종선발인원 : 5명 (각 과정별 1~2명)&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 장학기간 : 학위기간(2010.9 ~ )&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">2. 선발방법 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 29.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">학사/석사/박사 과정별로 학교성적 최고득점자 순으로 1명씩 선발하고, 나머지 인원은 박사, 석사, 학사 과정 순으로 우선 선발함.&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 특정 과정의 지원자가 없을 경우 타 과정 차점자를 선발함. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 본원 1차 선발 후 장학생 후보자로 추천되며, 최종 결정은 몽골정부에서 함&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">3. 장학금 지급내역</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">□ 수업료 면제&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 월생활비 지급 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">(*2009년 기준: US$ 63) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">의료보험료는 몽골정부의 사정에 따라 지원될 수도 있음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">4. 지원자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 한국국적 소지자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) (학사과정에 지원하는 경우) 고교졸업자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;<br>(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">석사과정에 지원하는 경우) 학사학위 소지자(2010.8월 학위취득예정자 포함)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">박사과정에 지원하는 경우) 석사학위 소지자(2010.8월 학위취득예정자 포함)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;3) 학교성적이 우수한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 심신이 건강한 자 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">5. 제출서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 서류 2)～6), 9), 10)은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">영문으로 발행 또는 작성</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">할 것.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">서류를 순서대로 철하여 원본 1세트와 사본 1세트로 제출하되, 스테이플러 미사용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 지원서 A (본원 소정양식-국문) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 지원서 B (몽골정부 소정양식 - 영문)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 39pt; TEXT-INDENT: -39pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;※몽골어학연수가 필요한 경우, 2. Programme Preferences 의 Preferred Programme 난에 Mongolian Language Programme(1year) and 지원과정(학․석․박사)로 기입할 것. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 졸업(예정)증명서 (영문)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 성적증명서 (영문)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 학사과정지원자-고교성적증명서&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;석사과정지원자-학사성적증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;박사과정지원자-석사성적증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 건강진단서(몽골정부 소정양식, HIV검사 포함, 최근 3개월 이내, 영문)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6) 이력서 및 학업계획서 (소정양식 없음, 1-2쪽, 영문)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;7) 여권사본 (2010.9.1 기준 유효기간 2년 이상이어야 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;8) 칼라사진 4장 (3×4)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;9) 추천서 (교수, 영문)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;10) 연구논문 목록(박사과정 지원자, 영문)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">6. 제출기한: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2010.7.14(수) 16:00</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">까지 <strong>국제교류센터</strong>로 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">개별지원은 불가</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">하며, 기한까지 도착하지 않은 서류는 일절 접수하지 않음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">7. 제출방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">지원자는 출신대학(원)에 지원서 및 관련서류를 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">※ 대학별 담당부서는 대체로 ‘장학/국제/학생복지’ 등이나, 정확한 부서는 대학마다 다르므로, 대학(본부)에 문의하기 바람.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 대학 담당자는 서류를 일괄 수합하여 총장명의로 마감기한 이내에 국립국제교육원(국제교류부)에 도착할 수 있도록 전자공문과 함께 송부</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">8. 기타 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">1차 합격자(후보자)발표(예정): 2010. 7. 26(월) 15:00</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> ‘개별통보’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 17pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">제출서류에 허위 사실이 발견될 경우 추후라도 합격을 취소하며, 제출된 서류는</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 일절 반환하지 않음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 16.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">공무원 및 병역미필자는 유학 가능여부를 각각 임용기관과 병무청에 개별적으로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 확인한 후 지원할 것.(인사, 병역 등의 문제는 지원자 책임이며, 특히 공무원은 휴직 가능여부를 인사권자에게 확인할 것)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 16.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -16.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">□ 선발된 후 유학을 포기할 경우, 향후 외국정부초청 장학생 지원시 불이익을 당하게 되니, 이 점을 유념하여 심사숙고한 후 지원하기 바람.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 17.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">□ 몽골</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 유학이나 몽골의 대학에 관한 자세한 정보는 몽골교육문화과학부 웹사이트를 참고하기 바람.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 17.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">□ 몽골정부초청 장학생은 왕복항공료 및 몽골에서의 숙식비 등을 본인이 부담해야 함을 유념하고, 몽골의 물가, 생활비 등을 고려하여 지원하기 바람. </span></p>\n첨부 1. 2010-2011 몽골 정부초청장학생 선발요강.hwp<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2.&nbsp;지원서A(본원 소정양식- 국문).hwp<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3.&nbsp;지원서B(몽골정부 소정양식- 영문).pdf<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4. 건강진단서(영문).pdf&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br><br><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;국 제 교 류 센 터<br></font><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
